<Institutional title="Privacy Policy" description="Learn how CleanMa collects, uses and safeguards personal data." path="/privacy">
  <span class="slbl">Legal</span><h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
  <p class="cma-last-updated">Last Updated: November 10, 2026</p>
  <p>CleanMa is committed to protecting the privacy of our customers and their workers. This Privacy Policy explains how personal data is collected, used, and safeguarded in accordance with the UK GDPR and the Data Protection Act 2018.</p>
  <h2>2.1 Information We Collect</h2>
  <p><strong>Account Information:</strong> Name, business email address, company address, phone number, and billing details.</p>
  <p><strong>Operational Data:</strong> Worker rosters, check-in timestamps, GPS location data (only when clocking in/out if enabled), absence records, and hourly rate parameters.</p>
  <p><strong>Technical Data:</strong> IP address, browser type, device information, and session logs.</p>
  <h2>2.2 How We Use Your Information</h2>
  <ul><li>To provide, maintain, and improve the CleanMa platform features.</li><li>To process subscription payments and calculate payroll integration specs.</li><li>To send system notifications, security alerts, and customer support communications.</li></ul>
  <h2>2.3 Data Sharing &amp; Processors</h2>
  <p>We do not sell personal data. Data is shared strictly with sub-processors required to deliver the Service:</p>
  <ul><li><strong>Supabase:</strong> Database hosting and authentication infrastructure.</li><li><strong>Stripe:</strong> Payment processing and billing operations.</li><li><strong>Xero / Accounting Platforms:</strong> Optional third-party integrations initiated by the user.</li></ul>
  <h2>2.4 Your Rights under UK GDPR</h2>
  <p>Under UK data protection laws, individuals have rights including access to personal data stored in your workspace, rectification of inaccurate information, and erasure (the Right to be Forgotten) subject to legal retention obligations.</p>
  <p>For data privacy inquiries, contact: <a href="mailto:support@cleanmaapp.com">support@cleanmaapp.com</a>.</p>
</Institutional>
